{% comment %}
@description: Breadcrumb dung chung toan site, style theo breadcrumbVariant.
@required_substrings: breadcrumbs, breadcrumbVariant, item.name, item.url
@required_ids: 
@notes: Nhan breadcrumbs[] moi item co name/url va breadcrumbVariant ('blog'|'product'|'default'). PHAI tu an khi breadcrumbs rong/null. Co the doi style rieng theo variant, nhung khong bo aria-label Breadcrumb va khong bo aria-current tren item cuoi.
{% endcomment %}
{% if breadcrumbs and breadcrumbs.size > 0 %}
<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="variant-{{ breadcrumbVariant }}">
    ...
    <ol>
    {% for item in breadcrumbs %}
        <li {% if forloop.last %}aria-current="page"{% endif %}>
            <a href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.name }}</a>
        </li>
    {% endfor %}
    </ol>
</nav>
{% endif %}